{{!-- primitive-chart — recharts line/bar chart over a grouped projection's
  LIST response (M-T1.3).

  shadcn has no chart package of its own; its documented chart is a thin
  wrapper over recharts, so the pack binds recharts directly and dresses it in
  the theme's CSS variables (`--primary` for the mark, `--border` for the grid,
  `--muted-foreground` for the axes).  That keeps the chart on the pack's own
  tokens — which is what the per-pack WCAG-AA contrast gate reasons about —
  instead of introducing a chart-only palette no other primitive shares.

  A chart is an image of data, so the wrapper carries `role="img"` plus the
  walker-derived `aria-label` (same contract as primitive-data-grid).  One
  series, so no legend: the label names the measure, and a legend box for a
  single mark is noise.  The grid and axes stay recessive and the line stays
  thin (2px, no per-point dots) so the data, not the chrome, carries the eye. --}}
    <div role="img" aria-label="{{ariaLabel}}"{{{testidAttr}}} className="h-[300px] w-full">
      <ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height="100%">
{{#if isLine}}        <LineChart data={ {{{dataExpr}}} }>
          <CartesianGrid strokeDasharray="3 3" stroke="var(--border)" />
          <XAxis dataKey="{{dataKey}}" stroke="var(--muted-foreground)" fontSize={12} />
          <YAxis stroke="var(--muted-foreground)" fontSize={12}{{#if hasIntegerAxis}} allowDecimals={!({{{integerAxisExpr}}})}{{/if}} />
          <Tooltip contentStyle=\{{ background: "var(--popover)", border: "1px solid var(--border)", borderRadius: "var(--radius)", color: "var(--popover-foreground)" }} />
          <Line type="monotone" dataKey="{{seriesField}}" stroke="var(--primary)" strokeWidth={2} dot={false} />
        </LineChart>
{{else}}        <BarChart data={ {{{dataExpr}}} }>
          <CartesianGrid strokeDasharray="3 3" stroke="var(--border)" />
          <XAxis dataKey="{{dataKey}}" stroke="var(--muted-foreground)" fontSize={12} />
          <YAxis stroke="var(--muted-foreground)" fontSize={12}{{#if hasIntegerAxis}} allowDecimals={!({{{integerAxisExpr}}})}{{/if}} />
          <Tooltip contentStyle=\{{ background: "var(--popover)", border: "1px solid var(--border)", borderRadius: "var(--radius)", color: "var(--popover-foreground)" }} />
          <Bar dataKey="{{seriesField}}" fill="var(--primary)" radius={[4, 4, 0, 0]} />
        </BarChart>
{{/if}}      </ResponsiveContainer>
    </div>
